WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,600
Without third-level strength, how can a weak male hurt you?

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:09,600
There are two males in the secret spirit, one is at the third level and the other is at the fifth level.

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:14,600
Sharing photos of them coming here to breed, I didn’t expect that the fifth-grade one clipped off one of my wings.

4
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,600
I hid in the secret soul Dongduo for a few days before carefully escaping back.

5
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:22,060
Fifth grade?

6
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:28,100
No problem, wait until the day when the magnetic speed is revealed, no matter how strong the male is, he will have to be subdued

7
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:31,100
If I eat that fifth-grade one, I can be promoted to seventh-grade

8
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:35,100
A daughter of the third rank, if you eat it, you will be promoted to the fourth rank

9
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:38,220
Then you will be able to grow wings again

10
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:39,220
Lord Ling is wise

11
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:44,220
There haven't been any birds these past few days. I'm so hungry.

12
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:51,580
Those who lost the birds were defeated. The birds were deliberately avoiding this dense forest.

13
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,380
What to do?

14
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:56,510
Change the recipe, there is a lot to eat outside

15
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:59,660
Listen to the boss
